        "Chloe registered the amber jacket under label Harbor and stored it in the university. Chloe kept a brown truck in the pharmacy, labeled Pine. During the lesson, staff reviewed an empty tablet for the exhibit. The brown drum in the market belonged to Robert and carried the label Orchard. A short note about the drum circulated after the game. The label Harbor identified the jacket. A notice from Quinn stated that Robert painted the Orchard maroon. This was the first reported change to the color of the drum. Several visitors discussed the drum near the market. Isaac said: Robert handed the Orchard to Isaac. Throughout the revision, the jacket kept Chloe as its owner. A short note about the drum",
